  "notes": "Expand the sequential power test to twelve guarded two-second stages with independent bottom and cartridge LED brightness levels and a second display backlight level. Subtract each existing off-load baseline, preserve separate cartridge INA readings, and classify brightness response using measured noise and charger-estimate consistency. Add fresh plausible sensor and thermistor diagnostics with explicit manual-stimulus and inconclusive states. Preserve seven-block battery references and migrate earlier power-test journals without overwriting their legacy storage keys.",
